  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:600e942069466c8641760af8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我非常开心！　但是，我不会放松\n警惕的。毕竟我，还在半路呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7931228276d49550324c88e0d8fab0947a98e30d975125a3851cf8526dba6e96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1167"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e13aa2ad739bddb99a53fc34",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为决定了绝对不会让给任何人——\n……欸嘿嘿，我的优点就是固执嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2216587b557550270ed8c8b07ea5e1fd8a438861180bddd7f1e58f5c8d0e181f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1168"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d54acf699328eb70d7dfb81d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我非常开心！　但是，我不会放松\n警惕的。毕竟我，还在半路呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7931228276d49550324c88e0d8fab0947a98e30d975125a3851cf8526dba6e96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1169"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50531fd07d9a42d2ebdea789",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的……被说了「表现得很不错」……\\n这让我感到非常高兴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c325106eccb0ca099319b6fa1ded54a8604e32387be6440e413b388db1c3f82",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c158cf591f4d3a6e8626f533",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Bravi！　每一个人的声音都化作音乐，\n传达给了我。当然……也包括你的声音哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1e7b037b6c7ee6ede398dfe2bca678975fded39b962e74437dc010a18e3e135",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1170"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c7cf7c5a008aa67d9dd6318",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真希望这能永远持续下去。\nCantabile……真是一场幸福的合奏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44939587656fa40da2d6d3d0fe6c688b8edc9750f5f918539433adf11534935c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbc86d3e1df8c61d7fdcc4ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我把它谱成曲送给你吧！　我这就去拿\n小提琴来。——欸？　因为是纸媒所以很苦恼？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d27a713874f7b9f715659bb2d70b19fbe1b30c116e4eed9d61fcc4f958034049",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1172"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b250d0e44d7b3cb7a4e1a34",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有强弱对比的乐谱\n是无法诞生震撼人心的旋律的。对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "91596c38b476920e0e3de1d21a9abe2ccc69a29584122d76ced0e83e6dfab86e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1173"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6b3125843efee21623995b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是节奏，是旋律，也是和声\n……是我不可或缺的『音符』本身哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c2d0797ff0246126753797415f3ba8a0a06fdbff2b46e272d1d6ad700be04a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1174"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ecfa716e3ef6eb0de047f21",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我把它谱成曲送给你吧！　我这就去拿\n小提琴来。——欸？　因为是纸媒所以很苦恼？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d27a713874f7b9f715659bb2d70b19fbe1b30c116e4eed9d61fcc4f958034049",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1175"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e9d5f1200fbe074bcd40315",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有强弱对比的乐谱\n是无法诞生震撼人心的旋律的。对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "91596c38b476920e0e3de1d21a9abe2ccc69a29584122d76ced0e83e6dfab86e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1176"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02b34508f95fd5d8ce62c02f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是节奏，是旋律，也是和声\n……是我不可或缺的『音符』本身哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c2d0797ff0246126753797415f3ba8a0a06fdbff2b46e272d1d6ad700be04a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1177"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ddaf32325abf0d339a33af4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，我已经拿到了哦。精力充沛的欢呼声\n才是让我心头一颤的最棒奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "042b7edb681e65f0e880ba7d20ca087a21aafccf68dd1a7824584d2309bc07e9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1178"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfbd8bf64aa51fd1a3f3f322",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看来已经传达到了呢。我……不，是我们\n演奏的音乐。来吧，大家一起歌唱吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95ec2f6df625d2d38e19609be0d7d55eb7e3a899004258bc06efcc3a6394e335",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1179"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd6869d34c23d7d892bf707e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的……一想到有这么多人为我加油，\\n就觉得之后也要尽力表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d56fc57e8ba9afe88d6c695383b1c2dd15e88a57aab337702de89c2ee7f1d17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c88b58f8b025fc9fa72806b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，我已经拿到了哦。精力充沛的欢呼声\n才是让我心头一颤的最棒奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "042b7edb681e65f0e880ba7d20ca087a21aafccf68dd1a7824584d2309bc07e9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1180"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7199550990341b261d2bafd4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看来已经传达到了呢。我……不，是我们\n演奏的音乐。来吧，大家一起歌唱吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95ec2f6df625d2d38e19609be0d7d55eb7e3a899004258bc06efcc3a6394e335",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48d1787a4cb0b8e2984ab083",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "过去的赛事，我反复回看了很多遍。\n多亏了这样，我才能做到『斗魂突进！』♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2c7489b2d550a72dab2749777f261ebb81ca93a830c1b1a66569d3ba40df914",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1182"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:553295b0561d1860aaee8968",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练也是穿搭的一部分！　为了能完美搭配\n直到今天我都是慎重地在进行安排！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97fabf656323176af449107922a22c46891ee983f806d5e051f124b775acb134",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1183"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efe366afddbf870bd8dea8ce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这是我从小就保持的习惯。在护理用品里加入\n能治愈身心的香气，身心状态都万无一失！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf2cab76dfe3175bf2cf653e34a8f90b82bf391fa85c7895a84bf8df7962e336",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1184"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82423d0343ffe309ab758d36",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，我想要新的测色布……\n因为这样就能提出更加具体、让人闪耀的建议了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "373180ed0c3ad8918c7bb2a37d4071d548d4adbd747f8fda977e54253984a307",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1185"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c2ad578fb040343b2cf8f2f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好的……啊，小真！　别表现得\n那么拘谨嘛。一起来拍吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "842ad8219f7fdadc02ecf26ff355d41b29fc7b55db660b95545bdbfbf5e1c39f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1186"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:330f6c7a1c7da00dfe44a660",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这是我从小就保持的习惯。在护理用品里加入\n能治愈身心的香气，身心状态都万无一失！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf2cab76dfe3175bf2cf653e34a8f90b82bf391fa85c7895a84bf8df7962e336",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1187"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3505c4693ffb33cd837dd7d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，我想要新的测色布……\n因为这样就能提出更加具体、让人闪耀的建议了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "373180ed0c3ad8918c7bb2a37d4071d548d4adbd747f8fda977e54253984a307",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1188"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de2783518a8ed99836b956b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好的……啊，小真！　别表现得\n那么拘谨嘛。一起来拍吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "842ad8219f7fdadc02ecf26ff355d41b29fc7b55db660b95545bdbfbf5e1c39f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1189"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ac43656562e4da94c05d7dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊，谢谢你的祝贺……哎呀～偶尔也是会发生\\n罕见的情况呢～我开玩笑的，哈哈……",
      "source_fingerprint": "70c3899708c6ea2c207d7f168c12c86d6c8aa490ad63d73fdd583b0d8441cbce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00c3a85afec613744a59202a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在拍纪念照之前，我们先去\n选两人的衣服吧，这样！　呵呵，我很期待呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8d2f0c6d4fce4d767267581a3cedbc49d140d0d8f2301d794a1be777f33ff82",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1190"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92c44b95480482f959f52fbc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论谁都不必放弃，大家都能够闪闪发光，\n看了我的奔跑……希望大家能感受到这一点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3625be754348578ab4734cb12a70950a6d0a5f145bab255d9d39e8e7505eacb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cc9f6c46f6ef48fd16ffc2a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在拍纪念照之前，我们先去\n选两人的衣服吧，这样！　呵呵，我很期待呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8d2f0c6d4fce4d767267581a3cedbc49d140d0d8f2301d794a1be777f33ff82",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1192"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:606d6d17f41fc1bd47529a28",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论谁都不必放弃，大家都能够闪闪发光，\n看了我的奔跑……希望大家能感受到这一点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3625be754348578ab4734cb12a70950a6d0a5f145bab255d9d39e8e7505eacb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1193"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8429f6a8c61d5e5e93b01f61",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "迷上我了吧？\n尽情期待吧，下次也会让你大饱眼福的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a820895a92a5ea34806b879958570d372875695c00d5bb26df5c8ab822a19879",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1194"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cb6bdf767655f0aec9675fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以前的伙伴们为我庆祝了呢！\n真的是，最棒的死党啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9f687ec0e3d112e020f4719947f5480e48f3748fc3d36cd53a4aefe73ddc675",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1195"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48566df2b75099f289676b25",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好耶！！！！！\n果然这个瞬间最让人欲罢不能了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "763089072ee870f570a515b07ca16e07d42fb0a8bec31d0903673ecc6fcd564f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1196"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:803780c774732dbb22424701",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不需要什么战术。\n展现“最强”。仅此而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b63160594cb27ec0264fc3971a2b863ae539294e895cb97d681e5a95eda533fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1197"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3943fc436c8cc31049282023",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "热血沸腾啊。\n果然，要干就得找厉害的家伙！",
      "source_fingerprint": "632eb76ec2dc4639ea123a5e438ceb62998f46e49d58f71419a21a9656ce6fba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1198"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e58bc0412cfa096351e10fe6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好耶！！！！！\n果然这个瞬间最让人欲罢不能了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "763089072ee870f570a515b07ca16e07d42fb0a8bec31d0903673ecc6fcd564f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1199"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55fb87819f5b50ec908522ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我昨天很早就睡了。睡得很好。\\n咦？不是要问这个吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f85cbb03f04420abf3a00eebe142457fb78b4800954c8d9aaa7220ac3163a21",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0942d89b8a4f1bb2cd0b8591",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没、没有啦～要是被抬举成那样的话，\\n我可是会得意忘形的喔～？开玩笑的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "861b7e2adc0fbb4355f039948b309b9fc10979f14cd1bf7ea8aaa12ee64e2a05",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:019c58f7306e2dcae2ba6d1e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不需要什么战术。\n展现“最强”。仅此而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b63160594cb27ec0264fc3971a2b863ae539294e895cb97d681e5a95eda533fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a28a56644faf330dea2c3ca8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "热血沸腾啊。\n果然，要干就得找厉害的家伙！",
      "source_fingerprint": "632eb76ec2dc4639ea123a5e438ceb62998f46e49d58f71419a21a9656ce6fba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c554232b517da9e866b3cd1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "宣言而已。从现在起就是我的时代了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67e314daf4f76c2c6b983bc82cc10b84c601bd759ed2123ac744aec90f36db38",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1311e2acec0bbb9023f3affc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然是——\n哦，做到了搭档！　凯旋啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "740f7d4344f67a8dcffc62e2054391f1c4f4b64780480809fbce5fa51d27df37",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30d3ae458730e402bf5c60fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "宣言而已。从现在起就是我的时代了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67e314daf4f76c2c6b983bc82cc10b84c601bd759ed2123ac744aec90f36db38",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:973656349e38c6f20b9ebb71",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然是——\n哦，做到了搭档！　凯旋啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "740f7d4344f67a8dcffc62e2054391f1c4f4b64780480809fbce5fa51d27df37",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac4aa9b129ca4a55d9abdf10",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是这副身躯吧。\n父母赐予我的，重要的武器。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03f38dbfc392796c6b7056ed3218f75ee58891b280a485d719f96c7e7e8b9cc6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee3463c1d2f599607197e80e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在身体冷却下来之前要先做整理运动……\n啊，我并没有催促您的意思。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0f15429b0c6a76a733355d9cb2f052a103911d1300541cdc4455c22af0f4d49",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af4c11d29c800d846795890b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "硬要说的话，就是和妹妹一起吃饭吧。\n今天早上一起吃了茶泡饭……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63dfdcb8aea61637876f460bd2eda095d8c8bba540e8329e0914a8139d9f0b96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:279da945631849ed9be1575c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不知为何总会收到糖果作为赠品\n吧。这让我有点过意不去……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e10f2d6e5914382ae519e9554c70befe00e1493ce24445848115742530604d2f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:510281140fc8b89aae582f7a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然啰！我身为以超一流为目标的赛马娘，\\n怎么能允许自己在预赛就受到挫败！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0217cd3845ca5e37c04c6e019bfb720107b7c7d8da70845a8d3f6666f9e213cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61a06c997dfee95f6c18f03c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "向这样的我寄予厚望……\n真的，非常感谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "870dd3816d73449ba6dc002cb56052ec026683c20042443e0577c6b1782ba87a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15697ec110b300b53af2eba0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "硬要说的话，就是和妹妹一起吃饭吧。\n今天早上一起吃了茶泡饭……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63dfdcb8aea61637876f460bd2eda095d8c8bba540e8329e0914a8139d9f0b96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e9905096594f0bc1bf0b90d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不知为何总会收到糖果作为赠品\n吧。这让我有点过意不去……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e10f2d6e5914382ae519e9554c70befe00e1493ce24445848115742530604d2f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d78da488ddf407ab7010470",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "向这样的我寄予厚望……\n真的，非常感谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "870dd3816d73449ba6dc002cb56052ec026683c20042443e0577c6b1782ba87a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f519167bd87a8aa9737bbc2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『前往尽头的旅程』……\n呵，稍微有点耍帅过头了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19f98c972c8ccd0127c6638e40e597e228e2b9212863cc83e8f6a1b754ec7dba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12da7105c92cba8b14f546a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个时候，能被您选中真是太好了。\n今后也要……一起走下去好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d88635a88477b413edf2fbc698405a588a830eaee558d5988928ab18de6f40b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c1fc327a8cccb911ac911d2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『前往尽头的旅程』……\n呵，稍微有点耍帅过头了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19f98c972c8ccd0127c6638e40e597e228e2b9212863cc83e8f6a1b754ec7dba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f5bc70c456368dee94a2bcb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个时候，能被您选中真是太好了。\n今后也要……一起走下去好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d88635a88477b413edf2fbc698405a588a830eaee558d5988928ab18de6f40b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d319dee1154fff30f06d7125",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论晴天雨天直线就是直线。\n那我就不会将最速拱手相让！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53023d72c2c7e088c483b9d54b287ebe1db41cd364934f6a9f6b51055db15cf0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f2f8b112bacd2e0c9b6a1bc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "还差得远呢。\n我一定会，向着那道光的前方！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12f06129641385761615f866e48c0bb7335766193c2a7818baa3080802494785",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4eeda6f8b47c1346b820070",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我当然会华丽地获得胜利。\\n你就先做好再度采访我的准备吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "824775356e43fdd38ede80300bca3af13ccfe3e83a4f68b3fb2f618898d17583",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e258ead7e3a99809fe5aa224",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "猫咖！　蹭蹭摸摸毛茸茸！\n可爱的小猫咪Forever！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b3c92ed27014b5febce7ee060f19e81738c88aece01a4a2d30e621a5bd84342",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcafba727b739fe24a1912d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对吧！　不愧是我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1badacdaaeae3c1e43a25c5e3d66f94b932cd644ac5b843e5cb8c4e61969b91",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db6b2b004e3c8e28db1cf0e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "鸵鸟……真是个好对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6011b1a759154045113502fc36574e1542cea1489df42acd4343de02ee77f30",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14dbc05cee3530fca4aee55c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "猫咖！　蹭蹭摸摸毛茸茸！\n可爱的小猫咪Forever！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b3c92ed27014b5febce7ee060f19e81738c88aece01a4a2d30e621a5bd84342",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:950c42b9f15d9e6a59b72837",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对吧！　不愧是我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1badacdaaeae3c1e43a25c5e3d66f94b932cd644ac5b843e5cb8c4e61969b91",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ef2a6bd2d011201d8cb4834",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "鸵鸟……真是个好对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6011b1a759154045113502fc36574e1542cea1489df42acd4343de02ee77f30",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:600f03407eb97bccee21d4a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呀呼！　吼！！\n嘿嘿嘿——！！　这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59107daa7d4eb7a9d89b8a98658052441a38d59d1116aaec0db2609f97d69217",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e019e713ee76a684694c1760",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员！\n为了庆祝我要跳舞了。就现在！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef61e47100477088d695051aca4f6475c96ffc045e285ab7742da4c98e23bcba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:194da064c142d28d72971dde",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呀呼！　吼！！\n嘿嘿嘿——！！　这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59107daa7d4eb7a9d89b8a98658052441a38d59d1116aaec0db2609f97d69217",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1b65fa918ad44b982eeeb01",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员！\n为了庆祝我要跳舞了。就现在！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef61e47100477088d695051aca4f6475c96ffc045e285ab7742da4c98e23bcba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05fcbf36b8ff8ac3b7a2585f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是啊～没想到会突然流鼻血……\\n不过既然都赢了，也算是有个圆满的结果吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4505e7f34e8beeb23028079328eb7fc0bbcff922f324c1dbea5b9f5ecdd7b17b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9710e4cc6e776af5a2c7031f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀。是以前群访时见过的面孔呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "112192339edae5dec368927799763d2e8e5b0a2df98ae72246310f8062a48f9d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1230"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9d9bcb21e0fc117f61eb23e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "——矿石，就是要用矿石来打磨。\n只要一起度过时光，自然就会变得更加锐利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be7a7a0867d9403b0b0fd3b0fa569445287d77ab004ca5a0a03ca3b0002c744f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1231"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:017266cc359e5748a748ce03",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那种程度。想要『削弱』我，还差得远呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03949990ba8c189ebdd777a450af5a1c4880d6bf0fe340e104e878953e900053",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1232"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38f5990fe4df87ca03663f0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会让各位看到的——\n我将对手彻底压碎，取得胜利的身姿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b55c9702e792d5501e86d877bcefc19d9262c089e4121e44e6cfc00a082c059c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1233"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4720f96d07a1d969fae07d81",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我很期待各位在决赛的表现哦。\n——作为点缀我胜利的，装饰品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdd1583864dccfb572715494c5d6afd2b4e173eac175a2506d33c7e016116410",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1234"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1c54fd233f1263c06d12fd8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那种程度。想要『削弱』我，还差得远呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03949990ba8c189ebdd777a450af5a1c4880d6bf0fe340e104e878953e900053",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1235"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99d3b7ac0d548fe1a79214b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会让各位看到的——\n我将对手彻底压碎，取得胜利的身姿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b55c9702e792d5501e86d877bcefc19d9262c089e4121e44e6cfc00a082c059c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1236"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64754ab9a65e35ec957f6817",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我很期待各位在决赛的表现哦。\n——作为点缀我胜利的，装饰品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdd1583864dccfb572715494c5d6afd2b4e173eac175a2506d33c7e016116410",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1237"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d673ba2e5d33fa4d1b8e1cc4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "事到如今，不必多言。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1ed9dd0c780ba61e35c4249be3216ac8181fb2058e6e6f1f0c8cad325546d7e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
